[{:db/id 17592186162282 :question/worked-solution "Using the values in the table, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X=2\\,\\,\\text{and}\\,\\,Y\\le 4) & =P((X,Y)\\in \\{(2,2),(2,4)\\}) \\\\  & =P((X,Y)=(2,2))+P((X,Y)=(2,4)) \\\\  & =f(2,2)+f(2,4) \\\\  & =0.05+0.15 \\\\  & =0.2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186162073 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-d9a0e99d-ee2e-54a9-9f59-8e7f0b18bda7"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-d9a0e99d-ee2e-54a9-9f59-8e7f0b18bda7" :question/id #uuid "d9a0e99d-ee2e-54a9-9f59-8e7f0b18bda7" :question/math-academy-id "q-110966" :question/problem "|  | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ | $Y=3$ | $Y=4$ | $Y=5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.1$ | $0.01$ | $0.05$ | $0.025$ | $0.1$ |\n| $X=1$ | $0.025$ | $0.01$ | $0.01$ | $0.025$ | $0.05$ |\n| $X=2$ | $0.01$ | $0.05$ | $0.05$ | $0.1$ | $0.01$ |\n| $X=3$ | $0.1$ | $0.025$ | $0.1$ | $0.05$ | $0.1$ |\n\nCalculate $P(Y-X=2)$ given that the random variables $X$ and $Y$ have the joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ shown in the table above." :question/worked-solution "Using the values in the table, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(Y-X=2) & =P(X=0,Y=2)+P(X=1,Y=3) \\\\  & +P(X=2,Y=4)+P(X=3,Y=5) \\\\  & =f(0,2)+f(1,3)+f(2,4)+f(3,5) \\\\  & =0.01+0.01+0.1+0.1 \\\\  & =0.22.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-80684957-1816-5bbf-b499-0054dfab3f98"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-80684957-1816-5bbf-b499-0054dfab3f98" :answer-field/id #uuid "80684957-1816-5bbf-b499-0054dfab3f98" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-172b0d28-9053-5c75-82a3-9176b2177f7b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9c647d4a-3f89-51f3-80fe-0c630dad6a15" "answer-19dfeb7e-c8d5-5045-9993-de85d2a62535" "answer-311d7f39-80c9-5bd3-b7a2-7108330abf41" "answer-172b0d28-9053-5c75-82a3-9176b2177f7b" "answer-80910aba-a6f7-5cea-